# Package.resolved is intentionally COMMITTED (not ignored). SuiGrpcKit is a
# local package consumed by the app, and Package.swift uses open ranges
# (from: "2.0.0"), so a clean CI runner would otherwise resolve whatever is
# newest at archive time — silently shipping a different gRPC/NIO stack under
# the money path than the one that was tested. Pin it.
